/*
  bundles/human_common.spthy -- the always-needed human-layer plumbing, in one include.
  Every bundle-composed experiment pulls this once: the persistent current-mask gates
  (mask_state), the single-answer discipline (answered_once), and the Alex stress-enable
  (Stage B). Pair with one or more phase bundles (calc_phase / approve_phase / verify_phase /
  authorize_phase) and, for any post-KDF phase, protocol/session.spthy.
  To stress Blake instead of (or as well as) Alex, add protocol/stress_blake.spthy.
*/

